        callout: 'On Google Workspace, saving a meeting\'s rooms with Manage rooms sends the candidate and every interviewer on the invite a calendar update, the same as any other change to the event.  The rooms Ivy adds to a booked onsite day, and blocked rooms it takes off after a Manual Schedule save, change without a Google update to anyone.',
