          'TIME ZONE (your view) in the onsite tool changes only what you are looking at. For example, a day booked 9:00 AM CET in Berlin with a candidate on GMT reads 3:00 AM EST when you view Toronto and 12:00 AM PST when you view Los Angeles, and the candidate still reads 8:00 AM GMT. It never changes the booked time, the candidate time zone, the plan date, or your saved time zone. To read an interviewer time, switch the view to their time zone.',
