          'Onsite (Team Interview): Ivy calls this stage Onsite, and candidates see it as Team Interview in the talent portal.  It can be held virtually or in person, as the stage\'s location decides (see Onsite Interview Segments).',
          'Each company works in one of three onsite modes. In the standard mode, candidates pick their own onsite time from the scheduling email, unless a stage is set to ask them for availability only. When onsite days are booked by the hiring team, every Onsite stage asks the candidate for their availability, and the day is booked with the onsite scheduling tool (see Booking an Onsite Day). Onsite scheduling can also be turned off, in which case reaching an Onsite stage creates no interview and sends the candidate nothing.',
