          'Stage recommend and decide plan: the gate is OnsiteDecisionGate (decision_opens_at = end of the last remaining non-debrief meeting of the booked issue; no booked day holds nothing). S5 (backend c105fa38): resolve/journey early + early_reason_code (EarlyOnsiteDecisionReason) + early_reason, decision_timing early; preview GET .../resolve/journey/preview. S6a (frontend 53e75597): Decide before the day ends… (more menu + DecisionOpensNote link, A21), JourneyEarlyDecisionDialog, contact sentence (A22). S4b (77644cb7): a final decision cancels outstanding sessions (OIC::cancelForDecision future_only, only a day with a segment ahead; reject keeps cancelForJourneyExit) and owes the day-cancelled notice for cancelled segments that may be on the candidate\'s calendar, less a debrief (A16, A18).',
          'OnsiteStageDecisionService on a coordinator-booked day: contributors = every participant of any segment (required, optional, lunch guests) plus DH / HM / HR / TL; recommendations repeat and the latest per person counts (:43-51, 272-290; Feedback.vue no longer shows "You already submitted your feedback for this stage…" on onsite). Required set = required interviewers of presentation and interview segments (:53-64, 469-484). Deciders DH / HM / HR (:166-201), never TL, never auto-resolved. A legacy (candidate-booked) day still waits for every booked interviewer. Journey card: since stage decide S3a a decider recommends too (utils/stageWritingRights.ts), beside Reject / Advance to the next stage; isOnsiteDecider (can_decide || can_decide_when_open) now only holds Advance until the draft is non-blank (stageAdvanceNeedsFeedback) and InterviewStageDecisionService::resolveByAuthority refuses an onsite advance with blank feedback (422, field feedback, after the authority and gate checks). The Activity tab and the Interview Assistant let a decider recommend and link to the Candidate Journey for the decision.',
          'OnsiteDayLifecycle (:43-45, 95, 114-118): feedback request 15 minutes before each presentation / interview segment via OnsiteFeedbackRequestSender (HrInterviewFeedbackRequestMail + Slack, every participant incl. optional, one per segment, not logged); each segment moves to awaiting_hr_feedback when it ends; greeting, farewell and lunch get none. Legacy days keep SendHrFeedbackRequestJob 5 minutes after the start. Reminders InterviewReminderService::onsiteDayRows (:719-760): one candidate set per day keyed to the first segment, each interviewer before their own first segment, both kinds of day; on a plan day on several dates each date is a day of its own (one candidate set per date from that date\'s first segment, and each interviewer before their own first segment of each date; S6c-2, pinned across two dates by P6-10\'s OnsiteChangeRemindersTest); none for a day being booked or replaced.',
          'Lunch: guests always optional (OnsiteIssuePublisher:909-910, P4QA-01); invite = candidate required, guests and the rest of the day optional. On a day on several dates (P6-11, app/Services/Onsite/OnsiteLunchDay.php) a lunch covers only the people of its own date: its invite, the change preview and submit\'s guest sync, a lunch added by an amendment, the calendar reader and the nudge\'s "someone accepted" count; a day on one date takes the old path. A split day can have a lunch on each date (D15, D16, P6-7, P6-20a, P6-20b): each further lunch is a lunch row on its own date with its own segment_id, kept in config_snapshot.daily_lunches and projected on context.change.daily_lunches (guests, length and date as its meeting has them now, P6-7b), numbered across the plan ("Lunch 1", "Lunch 2"), never in the stage settings; each gets its own nudge pair, due an hour before its own lunch. Candidate lunch decline -> "Candidate declined the onsite lunch" to the authority (CandidateInterviewService:2974-3015), nothing cancelled. OnsiteLunchNudgeSender (:22-45, 238-251) 60 minutes before lunch to the main HM and HR ONLY (no DH, no TL): "Nobody has accepted the onsite lunch" (responses known, nobody from the day accepted) or "Onsite lunch: responses unknown" (invite not read in the last 30 minutes); skipped once someone accepted or the candidate declined lunch. It works only since 7c8d4f6a (staging F4).',
